      <title>NestJS 12升级踩坑：从Webpack换Rspack花掉整个周末</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260904/NestJS-12%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E8%B8%A9%E5%9D%91%E4%BB%8EWebpack%E6%8D%A2Rspack%E8%8A%B1%E6%8E%89%E6%95%B4%E4%B8%AA%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%AB/</link>
